Observation: Found several relevant papers. One notable result is "Attention with Linear Biases (ALiBi): Extending Context Lengths in Transformers" which explores a novel method for extending context without quadratic scaling. Another paper discusses "Memory-Augmented Transformers" for long-term context retention.

Thought: These papers seem directly relevant to the topic. I will read the "Attention with Linear Biases (ALiBi)" paper to understand its experimental approach and implications for extending context in LLMs.

